  "prompt": "生成8个魔法炼金工坊用深色木制书架变体。所有变体必须使用完全相同的书架主体、尺寸、层板结构、木纹风格和轮廓，仅改变各层内容物。主体为精细但不过度破损的深色木材，开放式正面，无玻璃门。每个书架的内容物占可用层板空间30%-70%，保留明显空隙，不要塞满。内容物以精细书本、古籍、卷册、薄册和少量成叠书籍为主，辅以极少量羽笔盒、纸卷、书挡、小沙漏或封蜡盒。8个变体的书籍数量、竖放横放方式、颜色和杂物组合必须不同，同时保持统一系列感。普通材质base或vertex color只能从以下色卡选取：#FFFDF6,#FEF9EA,#FDF2D7,#E9DABD,#CDBA97,#F8E8CF,#F1D7B2,#E7C393,#C9A06E,#9E7A55,#FFF7A8,#FCEF72,#F6E24B,#D1B825,#9C8510,#FFF3B7,#FDE674,#FCD75F,#FECD4D,#D1900B,#FFE2A0,#FFD170,#F8BC44,#E39F1A,#A96F05,#FBE3BD,#FDD8A3,#FDCC8F,#F1AD69,#D99256,#FFD2BA,#FFB08\nCoordinate contract: local Y+ is up, local Z+ is the front, entrance, or forward direction, and local X+ is right. Put doors, facades, openings, windshields, noses, seats, and other recognizable front details toward local Z+. For a modular repeated element, explicitly choose the long axis: side-by-side modules span local X with depth/front on local Z; traversal modules span local Z. Keep the model centered at its origin.\nCanonical dimensions contract: width=1.55, height=2.75, depth=0.5 world units. Keep the generated mesh within this centered bounding size.\nCreate variation 4 of 8; preserve the same reusable asset family while varying silhouette and details.",
